  "html": "\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>关 于 我 们</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Welcome</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>橄 榄 树 基 金 <br>(事工/团契)</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>橄榄树基金 是一个以基督教为信仰基础的非赢利组织，我们是一群耶稣基督的跟随者、不隶属於任何教派、政治及商业团体。我们愿意顺从神的带领，成为爱和福音的传播者</p><p>We are a Christ based not for profit organization, not under any denomination or church, nor related to any political groups or profit entities.We are willing to obey God’s leadership and become a communicator of love and gospel.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"644\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_32ec.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"690\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6951.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t"
